# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify only — GitHub Pages ignores this file entirely.
#
# Canonical page URLs keep their .html extension in the sitemap / GitHub Pages
# cutover (see astro.config.mjs build.format = 'file').
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT 301 /map → /map.html (or guide/status/offline). On Cloudflare
# Pages, requesting *.html already 308s to the extensionless path, so those rules
# create an infinite redirect loop (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS) — which breaks the
# Map tab iframe on lab.nexttrain.co.za. Pages serves map.html at /map natively.
#
# Fold only the trailing-slash variants into the extensionless form CF prefers.

/guide/   /guide   301
/map/     /map     301
/status/  /status  301
/offline/ /offline 301
/index.html  /  301

